extends layout

block content
  h2.heading-text Storage Freed!
  p Hello #{userName || 'User'},
  
  p Our automated systems have performed a routine cleanup of your trash to keep your account running smoothly.
  
  .alert-box.alert-success
    strong Recovery Status: 
    | We've permanently deleted #{itemCount} expired items, recovering 
    strong #{freedAmount} 
    | of storage for you.
  
  p By permanently removing items that have been in the trash for over 30 days, we ensure you have more room for your important files.
  
  a.button(href=actionUrl || '#') Manage Storage
  
  p.small-text If you'd like to adjust your trash settings or keep items for longer, please visit your account dashboard.
